          <td>Waiting for one consolidated set of comments</td>
          <td>The buyer's reviewers</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Retouch</th>
          <td>Turnaround, if you pay for a faster tier</td>
          <td>The daily volume cap on that tier</td>
